<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Unholy Grasp</h1>
<p>Sphere: Divine Sphere
Spell Tier: 3
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 50), Necromancer (guild level 120)
Mana: 30
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast unholy grasp &lt;target&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast unholy grasp</a>   (at whoever you are fighting)
</pre>
<p>A stronger prayer to the dark forces than unholy touch: the caster grasps 
at the target, and those who lean to good are hurt badly. Any target whose 
alignment is above neutral can be struck, and the truly good are hurt more; on the evil and the neutral, 
nothing happens. The better your divine power and sphere, the more it 
hurts. It does a little better against light armour than against plate, 
and a shield can block it.
</p><p>Casting it is an attack and starts a fight. The strongest of these prayers 
is unholy shout.
</p><p><br />
